  "limits": [
    "No Windows 10 / Intel Iris Xe or ThinkPad E15 Gen 2 runtime was available. The laptop-wide freeze remains unconfirmed as resolved.",
    "Windows, macOS and Android packages were audited, not target-OS runtime-tested. Renderer policy tests run on Linux with NVIDIA Vulkan and Mesa llvmpipe OpenGL. Windows CMD arguments and packaging were checked, but cmd.exe was not executed.",
    "The Windows enhanced-renderer trial arms its fallback when game scripts begin. Failures before that point require Play-Compatibility.cmd; no native pre-script Windows crash guard is claimed.",
    "A previously observed nonfatal shader-cache header error is not addressed. Browser checks cover startup/storage upgrade, not campaign gameplay. Audio uses Dummy; physical devices and remote co-op peers were not retested.",
    "No performance claim is made for the affected laptop. Compatibility intentionally has fewer effects; the default Windows backend remains Forward+ / D3D12."
  ],
